  "dct_description_sm": [
    "The field work gathered data on Arctic species flowering times and traits to support interpretation of the phenology stage of herbarium specimens and to be used in the analysis of plant flowering time responses to climate change. The data collected at Cambridge Bay were (i) flowering times of plant species, (ii) plant species reproductive phenological progression photographs, (iii) species overwintering flower bud stage and (iv) herbarium specimens."
